It is the realm of [[Lore:Aetherius|Aetherius]] where dead Nord heroes are rewarded by [[Lore:Shor|Shor]] with an eternity of revelry in the [[Skyrim:Hall of Valor|Hall of Valor]]. It is here where you must defeat [[Skyrim:Alduin|Alduin the World-Eater]].

